  "metadata": {
    "alignment": "unspecified",
    "description": "r0b0tlab’s single-GB10 native-SM121 vLLM profile for Poolside Laguna S 2.1 NVFP4, refreshed to the August 2026 primary checkpoint 826aacdf and its quantization-matched DFlash-NVFP4 drafter b3b5921a. The checkpoint now ships with a native 1,048,576-token context; this recipe retains the upstream adapter’s source-qualified 262,144-token / 32-sequence profile, FlashInfer attention, FlashInfer-CUTLASS NVFP4 experts, FP8 KV, and DFlash K=7. The specialized image remains pinned to r0b0tlab’s immutable vLLM 0.25.1 SM121/FlashInfer build; Poolside requires vLLM 0.25.0 or later and the model is loaded from mounted files with trust-remote-code. The source repository’s measured performance and quality evidence remains bound to its older 07614121 / 72379475 checkpoint pair and does not validate these changed weights. Current target and draft compatibility, context behavior, memory fit, tool behavior, and output quality remain unverified. Licences: target OpenMDW 1.1; package MIT; vLLM Apache-2.0; draft card declares no licence (information only).",
